    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῡμέα</span></b>  (in codd. freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρυμαία</span>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bag</i> or <i>chest</i> for old
			clothes, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				127
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.60
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρυμεῖα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γροφ-εία</span></b> , ibid., <i>Et.Gud.d.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρύτη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), <i>trash, trumpery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>riff-raff</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήτορας καὶ ποιητὰς καὶ πᾶσαν τὴν
					τοιαύτην γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.65
				</span></i>
			 W., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				21.257a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. παντοδαπῶν βιβλίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Isid.</u>
					293
				</span></i>
			:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῡμεοπώλης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
